toh20.txt holds the 20 instances of the Towers of Hanoi with four pegs and
20 disks of L. Siag, S. S. Shperberg, A. Felner and N. R. Sturtevant, "On
parallel external-memory bidirectional search", ECAI 2024, each line the
four pegs of the start and then the four pegs of the goal, a peg being
"(p)" followed by its disks from the bottom, from
https://github.com/SPL-BGU/PEM-BiHS (commit 83c5319), under the MIT
